&lt;p&gt;I first presented this initiative at cuttingEEG in October 2024, in the name of our core team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- The core values we aim to put forward are: --&gt;
&lt;!-- - Validity: Scientific robustness and integrity in the face of rapidly evolving methods --&gt;
&lt;!-- - Democratization: Diversity, inclusion, and impact for all --&gt;
&lt;!-- - Responsibility: What we do, who it impacts, what it sustains --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read all about it &lt;a class="reference external" href="https://cuttingeeg.github.io/EEG101CommunityFramework/"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;  and consider engaging/signing/discussing!&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>call</category><category>other</category><guid>http://dominikwelke.github.io/news/2026-01-community-framework-launch/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>